# =====================================================================
#  ScreenBot Pro - optional local credential override
# =====================================================================
#  Copy this file to ".env" ONLY if you want to keep your key on the
#  device instead of in %APPDATA%\ScreenBot\config.json.
#
#  ScreenBot resolves your Gemini API key in this order
#  (first NON-BLANK value wins):
#
#    1. System environment variable  GEMINI_API_KEY / GOOGLE_API_KEY
#    2. The .env file  (next to ScreenBot.exe)
#    3. %APPDATA%\ScreenBot\config.json   <-- recommended place for your key
#    4. config.json  (next to ScreenBot.exe)
#
#  DO NOT put a real key in the config.json that sits next to ScreenBot.exe
#  and DO NOT put one in a .env that you ship inside a shared .zip. Both
#  files are distributed to your friends. Run SETUP.bat instead: it writes
#  your key to %APPDATA%\ScreenBot\config.json, which stays on your PC.
#
#  Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
# =====================================================================
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
